{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ST", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}, \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$g : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0007": "$1$", "MATH_0008": "$$\ng \\circ f : \\mathcal{X} \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{Z}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$1$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-representable-transformations}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:314584c2008876c2ff7d0dedcdfb70fee1c4d58656b489494ba85ff198d54382", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c21a10f9af5b2905527f7c1617f20520b1d0b6c979fc9538fa1a77c3e95aede0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>\nLet <MATH_0005>, <MATH_0006>\nbe representable <MATH_0007>-morphisms. Then\n<MATH_0008>\nis a representable <MATH_0009>-morphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d5f459bb87b50bf4077664e44e02448cb88354a84cd5a748c40b959719dd6566", "unit_id": "tag:02ZS:statement"}
