{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ST", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}, \\mathcal{Y}, \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$g : \\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{Z} \\times_{g, \\mathcal{Y}, f} \\mathcal{X} \\ar[r]_-{g'} \\ar[d]_{f'} &\n\\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^f \\\\\n\\mathcal{Z} \\ar[r]^g & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$f'$", "MATH_0011": "$1$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-representable-transformations}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d7a5f3d7980b68c996abe22b3d76656c7c62c3a84dfc09c1c7b1554d05368c9b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:27ff1ffb48d115fe1befab9edcab6c8c0768ab6f1553c37aaec8a2f8d5737e10", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>\nbe categories fibred in groupoids over <MATH_0004>\nLet <MATH_0005> be a representable <MATH_0006>-morphism.\nLet <MATH_0007> be any <MATH_0008>-morphism.\nConsider the fibre product diagram\n<MATH_0009>\nThen the base change <MATH_0010> is a representable <MATH_0011>-morphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e28a7af6c0f2b672de06ce5013f4d837cff83616c04401e26d6e6f4695558301", "unit_id": "tag:02ZT:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ST", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a65bd317dca5708d4bb65d1c675374bcafbaa2544e926240c9555bf0ac59aadc", "source_text": "This is entirely formal and works in any category.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ded7fd3e85f4ed5567f1e9f28ba9572642bb6eaff86f24136ab7f2ceead4080e", "unit_id": "tag:02ZT:proof"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04ST", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{X}_i, \\mathcal{Y}_i$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0006": "$f_i : \\mathcal{X}_i \\to \\mathcal{Y}_i$", "MATH_0007": "$i = 1, 2$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "MATH_0009": "$$\nf_1 \\times f_2 :\n\\mathcal{X}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{Y}_2\n$$", "MATH_0010": "$1$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-product-representable-transformations}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0b9e417804af539c64416f4df9fde27287ca42c7edd1f0545b96a1e9e010bb9b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cba4d94b16a6df0fe10d31ee7ebaa31bcc64d012624c6941cca4a9b4decad4ee", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003> be categories fibred in groupoids over\n<MATH_0004>, <MATH_0005>.\nLet <MATH_0006>, <MATH_0007>\nbe representable <MATH_0008>-morphisms.\nThen\n<MATH_0009>\nis a representable <MATH_0010>-morphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:52771ce6d5e485a42e956eb3566f9c6dcf64677edcc5890c69d60a6cc1c5d881", "unit_id": "tag:02ZU:statement"}
{"chapter": "algebraic", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04ST", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f_1 \\times f_2$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2 \\to\n\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2 \\to\n\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{Y}_2$", "MATH_0003": "$f_1$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{X}_2 \\to \\mathcal{Y}_1$", "MATH_0005": "$f_2$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{Y}_1 \\times \\mathcal{Y}_2 \\to \\mathcal{Y}_2$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-composition-representable-transformations}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-representable-transformations}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:3e539211ac6ee5a1c0ed4b7954dd4531cf7de6dd1e5800e839c340935a510b01", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:615dd8efdd277111f11c1c1ad7884b54bed509405b975d5a932fd73b6476128e", "source_text": "Write <MATH_0001> as the composition\n<MATH_0002>.\nThe first arrow is the base change of <MATH_0003> by the map\n<MATH_0004>, and the second arrow\nis the base change of <MATH_0005> by the map\n<MATH_0006>.\nHence this lemma is a formal\nconsequence of Lemmas <REF_0001>\nand <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f6112264a0c2b59b41117ada6031bb289bbda87839d6b616d010007562767272", "unit_id": "tag:02ZU:proof"}
